data: {"type": "module_done", "module_id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "design": {"name": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "description": "TOF Start-Trigger Photodiode & UV Beam Diagnostics Module (compact linear layout). Receives an 8 mW 355 nm auxiliary fiber launch from uv_source_attenuator. A half-wave plate and polarizing beamsplitter split the beam into two branches: (1) the transmitted H-polarized branch stays linear along +x through two steering mirrors into the UV reference fiber coupler FC_diag (mode-matched with w=0.80 mm into f=11 mm, MFD=3.2 um UV single-mode fiber); (2) the reflected V-polarized branch folds along +y, passes a 5% fused-silica sampler (pickoff monitored by PD_mon) and an f=75 mm focusing lens into the fast silicon TOF digitizer start-trigger photodiode PD_tof_trig.", "modules": [{"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "title": "TOF Start-Trigger Photodiode & UV Beam Diagnostics Module", "region": [25.0, 775.0, 450.0, 300.0], "description": "Receives the auxiliary 355 nm pickoff fiber from uv_source_attenuator, splits the beam with a HWP + PBS into a fast time-of-flight (TOF) digitizer start-trigger photodiode branch (with a focusing lens and sampler dump) and a continuous UV power-stability & spatial reference fiber coupler (FC_diag) with two steering mirrors."}], "baseplate": {"width_mm": 600.0, "height_mm": 1100.0, "thickness_mm": 25.4, "optical_height_mm": 12.7, "grid_mm": 25.0}, "sources": [{"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "label": "355 nm Aux Fiber Launch (from FC_aux)", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "PAF2-11A", "position": [70.0, 865.0], "direction_deg": 0.0, "wavelength_nm": 355.0, "power_mw": 8.0, "waist_mm": 0.8, "waist_offset_mm": 180.0, "polarization": "H", "enabled": true}], "elements": [{"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.HWP1", "type": "half_wave_plate", "label": "Split-Ratio lambda/2 (355 nm)", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "WPH05M-355", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "distance_mm": 50.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": 22.5, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.PBS1", "type": "pbs", "label": "Trigger / Diagnostics PBS Cube", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "PBS12-355", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "distance_mm": 50.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": 90.0, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.M1", "type": "mirror", "label": "Diagnostics Walk Mirror 1", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "PF05-03-F01", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.t", "distance_mm": 110.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": 90.0, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.M2", "type": "mirror", "label": "Diagnostics Walk Mirror 2", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "PF05-03-F01", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.t", "distance_mm": 70.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": 0.0, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.FC_diag", "type": "fiber_coupler", "label": "UV Diagnostics Fiber Coupler (SM300)", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "PAF2S-11A", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.t", "distance_mm": 120.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": 11.0, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": 3.2, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.S1", "type": "sampler", "label": "UV Trigger Branch Sampler (5%)", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "BSF05-UV", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.r", "distance_mm": 60.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": 180.0, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": 0.05, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.PD_mon", "type": "photodiode", "label": "Pulse Energy Monitor PD", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "SM05PD2A", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.r.r", "distance_mm": 65.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.LENS_trig", "type": "lens", "label": "Trigger Focusing Lens (f=75 mm)", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "LA4725-UV", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.r.t", "distance_mm": 55.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": 75.0, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.PD_tof_trig", "type": "photodiode", "label": "Fast TOF Start-Trigger Photodiode", "group": "tof_trigger_diagnostics", "part_number": "DET10A2", "beam": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.r.t", "distance_mm": 65.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}], "targets": [{"element_id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.PD_tof_trig", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 2.0}, {"element_id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.FC_diag", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 1.5}, {"element_id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.FC_diag", "kind": "min_coupling", "value": 0.65}], "notes": "[tof_trigger_diagnostics] HWP1 at 22.5 deg splits the 8 mW 355 nm beam 50:50 at PBS1 (4 mW H transmitted along +x, 4 mW V reflected along +y). The transmitted diagnostics beam runs along +x to dogleg steering mirrors M1 (255, 90) and M2 (255, 160) and enters FC_diag at (375, 160) with ~99% mode-matching efficiency (~3.95 mW coupled). The reflected TOF trigger branch passes 5% sampler S1 at (145, 150) (pickoff to PD_mon at (80, 150)) and focusing lens LENS_trig at (145, 205) onto fast silicon detector PD_tof_trig at (145, 270), delivering 3.80 mW."}, "trace": {"segments": [{"id": "s0", "branch": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "source_id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "start": [70.0, 865.0], "end": [120.0, 865.0], "direction_deg": 0.0, "length_mm": 50.0, "wavelength_nm": 355.0, "freq_shift_mhz": 0.0, "power_mw": 8.0, "jones": [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 0.0]], "polarization_label": "H", "waist_z_mm": 180.0, "rayleigh_mm": 5663.716333232303, "w0_mm": 0.8, "w_start_mm": 0.8004039172410277, "w_end_mm": 0.8002107106653301, "start_element": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "end_element": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.HWP1", "end_reason": "element"}, {"id": "s1", "branch": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "source_id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "start": [120.0, 865.0], "end": [170.0, 865.0], "direction_deg": 0.0, "length_mm": 49.99999999999999, "wavelength_nm": 355.0, "freq_shift_mhz": 0.0, "power_mw": 8.0, "jones": [[0.7071067811865475, 0.0], [0.7071067811865476, -6.123233995736767e-17]], "polarization_label": "D", "waist_z_mm": 130.0, "rayleigh_mm": 5663.716333232303, "w0_mm": 0.8, "w_start_mm": 0.8002107106653301, "w_end_mm": 0.8000798022833006, "start_element": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.HWP1", "end_element": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.PBS1", "end_reason": "element"}, {"id": "s2", "branch": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1.t", "source_id": "tof_trigger_diagnostics.L1", "start": [170.0, 865.0], "end": [280.0, 865.0], "direction_deg": 0.0, "length_mm": 110.0, "wavelength_nm": 355.0, "freq_shift_mhz": 0.0, "power_mw": 3.999999999999999, "jones": [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 0.0]], "polarization_label": "H", "waist_z_mm": 80.